# Promotion Action Logic Documentation

## Overview

This document outlines the action logic for different promotion types in the PromotionForm component. Each promotion type has specific action configurations that determine how the discount is applied.

## Action Object Structure

```typescript
interface PromotionAction {
  type: "PERCENT_OFF" | "FIXED_AMOUNT_OFF" | "FREE_SHIPPING" | "BOGO" | "FREE_PRODUCT";
  value: number | boolean | string;
d
}
```

## Promotion Type Mappings

```typescript
const PROMOTION_TYPE_TO_DISCOUNT_TYPE = {
